# Publish only the tracker itself. Everything else in this folder stays local.
#
# The folder is ~211 MB (189 MB of it Archive, plus multi-MB timestamped PDFs
# and the source reference PDFs). Only three files belong in
# the GitHub repo, so this ignores everything by default and re-admits them by
# name. New PDFs, archive snapshots and working files can never sneak into a
# commit by accident.

# 1. Ignore everything at the root
/*

# 2. Re-admit only what gets published
!/.gitignore
!/MOU_Compliance_Tracker.html
!/index.html
!/README.md
